WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.375 --> 00:00:02.002
Let's rack 'em up and knock 'em down.

00:00:07.424 --> 00:00:10.260
(Rumbling)

00:00:12.721 --> 00:00:13.680
(Distant gunfire)

00:00:13.764 --> 00:00:14.640
Buck: When you look at it…

00:00:14.973 --> 00:00:17.100
and don't pay any attention
to what's really going on…

00:00:17.518 --> 00:00:18.894
it's kinda beautiful.

00:00:19.728 --> 00:00:21.438
(Distant gunfire continues)

00:00:22.648 --> 00:00:24.149
(Distant explosion)

00:00:30.822 --> 00:00:32.950
Crosby: We came from every corner
of the country

00:00:33.033 --> 00:00:34.701
with a common purpose.

00:00:34.785 --> 00:00:36.578
Go, go, go, go, go, go!

00:00:37.496 --> 00:00:40.082
Crosby: To bring the war
to Hitler's doorstep.

00:00:48.173 --> 00:00:49.049
These daylight missions…

00:00:52.261 --> 00:00:54.054
they're suicide.

00:00:56.306 --> 00:00:57.766
Then what's the move?

00:01:02.729 --> 00:01:04.731
We lead our boys through it.

00:01:07.401 --> 00:01:10.320
(Men howling)

00:01:12.406 --> 00:01:17.661
♪

00:01:31.675 --> 00:01:32.718
Egan: We're gettin' through this.

00:01:34.428 --> 00:01:36.513
Even if the odds are stacked against us.

00:01:39.683 --> 00:01:41.935
Buck: First time in the sawmill, boys.

00:01:43.270 --> 00:01:45.105
Let's rack 'em up and knock 'em down.

